Title: CineVerse Sample
Credit: Written by
Author: CineVerse Team

INT. COMMUNITY CINEMA - NIGHT

MAYA (V.O.)
The first frame is always a promise.

JON (OSW)
(quietly)
You can hear the whole city breathing.

Maya checks the projector. A warm beam cuts through the dust.

JON
We should keep this moment.

MAYA
For everyone who has not found their story yet.

CUT TO:

EXT. ROOFTOP - DAWN

The skyline opens into a pale gold morning.
